WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.637
Here's the division of labor.

2
00:00:01.637 --> 00:00:05.790
The kit reads through Graph,
compares every input with its plan,

3
00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:10.662
writes the evidence, plans the rollback,
and publishes custom detections,

4
00:00:10.662 --> 00:00:14.575
but only from an approved plan,
with apply and the plan's hash.

5
00:00:14.575 --> 00:00:16.516
A person, under the change record,

6
00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:20.614
assigns roles through Privileged
Identity Management and signs in,

7
00:00:20.614 --> 00:00:25.215
moves an attack surface reduction or
prevention ring in Intune from the kit's

8
00:00:25.215 --> 00:00:27.084
values, approves the plan's hash,

9
00:00:27.084 --> 00:00:30.750
and changes device group levels
and exclusions in the portal.

10
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.825
Only one write is automated.

11
00:00:32.825 --> 00:00:37.072
Learn doesn't state the
detection API's GCC availability,

12
00:00:37.072 --> 00:00:41.930
so if a test-tenant call fails, the
portal path uses the same files.
